332
24:20.760 --> 24:23.600
Pray for rain for the people of Lanyang.

333
24:24.210 --> 24:25.210
Please, Magistrate.

334
24:25.520 --> 24:26.450
Please.

335
24:26.600 --> 24:29.299
Pray for rain for Lanyang.

336
24:29.341 --> 24:30.589
We're begging you.

337
24:30.630 --> 24:32.239
Pray for rain for Lanyang.

338
24:32.281 --> 24:32.999
We can't survive.

339
24:33.041 --> 24:34.721
