340
24:34.770 --> 24:35.319
Ridiculous!

341
24:35.361 --> 24:35.869
Please.

342
24:35.911 --> 24:36.671
What good is praying for rain?

343
24:37.120 --> 24:39.360
It's all superstition, meant to fool the common folk!

344
25:02.320 --> 25:03.250
