349
25:16.450 --> 25:20.779
Thank you, Magistrate!

350
25:20.821 --> 25:21.789
Lanyang still has hope!

351
25:21.831 --> 25:26.481
Thank you, Magistrate!

352
25:26.600 --> 25:27.600
Shang, have you lost your mind?

353
25:28.320 --> 25:29.229
